==English==

===Etymology===
[[defend#Verb|to defend]] + [[-er#English|-er]]

===Pronunciation===
*: {{rhymes|ɛndə(r)}}

===Noun===
{{wikipedia|defender (football)}}
{{en-noun}}

# Someone who [[defend]]s [[people]] or [[property]].
# {{legal}} A [[lawyer]] who [[represent]]s [[defendant]]s.
# A [[fighter]] who [[repel]]s an [[attack]].
# {{sports}} One of the [[players]] whose primary task is to [[prevent]] the opposition from [[scoring]].

